# 3D Flashcard Studio needs NO environment variables.
# Design, preview, STL generation, ZIP export and project storage all run in the browser;
# nothing is uploaded and no API keys or accounts are involved.
#
# Optional: disable Next.js build telemetry.
# NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1
#
# Note for Netlify: variables prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ are embedded in the browser bundle,
# so never put secrets in them (this app does not use any).
